{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794340906430,"sessionID":"ses_e38f2e3bfffecd83FRQMpSQm98","part":{"id":"prt_1c70d6588001QoaMpq1mPLwYVf","messageID":"msg_1c70d549b001fcd67md67TRBvg","sessionID":"ses_e38f2e3bfffecd83FRQMpSQm98","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794340906431,"sessionID":"ses_e38f2e3bfffecd83FRQMpSQm98","part":{"id":"prt_1c70d658c001nxvfXE6dVkJ2qL","messageID":"msg_1c70d549b001fcd67md67TRBvg","sessionID":"ses_e38f2e3bfffecd83FRQMpSQm98","type":"text","text":"<think>Let me look at the existing frontend files and requirements.lock to understand available packages.\n\nLet me check what's in the lock file (e.g., is Pillow available? probably not). The format must be decided from the file's content, not name — so I can use magic byte sniffing manually (PNG signature, JPEG SOI marker) rather than Pillow. That's simple enough.\n\nLet me check requirements.lock.","time":{"start":1794340906380,"end":1794340906424}}}
