{"type":"text","timestamp":1794341020854,"sessionID":"ses_e38f2e3bfffecd83FRQMpSQm98","part":{"id":"prt_1c70f24a1001SijyOmt29z8Jgr","messageID":"msg_1c70f0c63001gYBCn2uyEJHden","sessionID":"ses_e38f2e3bfffecd83FRQMpSQm98","type":"text","text":"<think>/tmp/opencode is root-owned and not writable. I'll create the venv inside /workspace/backend/.venv (already created? The first command failed before creating? Let's check: `python3.13 -m venv /workspace/backend/.venv && pip install ...` — venv creation succeeded probably, pip failed. Let me check).\n\nAlso, note pip install with hash requirements failed. Let me just install without the constraints hashes: pip install -r requirements.txt (no -c). Let me check if network works for pip.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794341020833,"end":1794341020851}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794341022942,"sessionID":"ses_e38f2e3bfffecd83FRQMpSQm98","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call-11e938db-9cd1-4e58-a98b-3cc1f1d11c3f","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"ls /workspace/backend/.venv/bin 2>/dev/null | head; /workspace/backend/.venv/bin/pip install -q -r /workspace/backend/requirements.txt 2>&1 | tail -5; /workspace/backend/.venv/bin/python -c \"import flask;print('flask',flask.__version__)\"","timeout":300000},"output":"Activate.ps1\nactivate\nactivate.csh\nactivate.fish\npip\npip3\npip3.13\npython\npython3\npython3.13\n<string>:1: DeprecationWarning: The '__version__' attribute is deprecated and will be removed in Flask 3.2. Use feature detection or 'importlib.metadata.version(\"flask\")' instead.\nflask 3.1.3\n","metadata":{"output":"Activate.ps1\nactivate\nactivate.csh\nactivate.fish\npip\npip3\npip3.13\npython\npython3\npython3.13\n<string>:1: DeprecationWarning: The '__version__' attribute is deprecated and will be removed in Flask 3.2. Use feature detection or 'importlib.metadata.version(\"flask\")' instead.\nflask 3.1.3\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"ls /workspace/backend/.venv/bin 2>/dev/null | head; /workspace/backend/.venv/bin/pip install -q -r /workspace/backend/requirements.txt 2>&1 | tail -5; /workspace/backend/.venv/bin/python -c \"import flask;print('flask',flask.__version__)\"","time":{"start":1794341020844,"end":1794341022924}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c70f24a5001ApTfYdJPrk4cmJ","sessionID":"ses_e38f2e3bfffecd83FRQMpSQm98","messageID":"msg_1c70f0c63001gYBCn2uyEJHden"}}
