{"type":"text","timestamp":1794341709943,"sessionID":"ses_e38f2e3bfffecd83FRQMpSQm98","part":{"id":"prt_1c719a864001mLrraYNuC61Bsd","messageID":"msg_1c719972f0019Bd04WfHImMz3i","sessionID":"ses_e38f2e3bfffecd83FRQMpSQm98","type":"text","text":"<think>The dynamic import for fetchMe is silly — just import it at the top. Let me fix that.\n\nAlso register returns {id, username, created_at} which is fine.\n\nLet me fix the import.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794341709924,"end":1794341709939}}}
